---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Somashiva™">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="inline-block py-1.5 px-5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#B8860B] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 shadow-sm">Legal & Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#7A5212] mt-2 mb-4 tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-[#4A3B2C] text-sm font-light">Effective Date: November 5, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-[#4A3B2C] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          By accessing or purchasing from Somashiva™, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please refrain from using our website or purchasing our products.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">2. Product Descriptions & Natural Variations</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          Because our crystals, mineral clusters, and singing bowls are 100% natural and handcrafted by artisans, each piece possesses unique variations in color, size, pattern, and mineral inclusion. These natural characteristics are hallmarks of authenticity and do not constitute defects.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">3. Store Purchases & Amazon Redirections</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          Somashiva™ offers dual checkout options: direct secure checkout via Razorpay and external redirection to Amazon.in via affiliate/partner product links. Transactions completed on Amazon are strictly subject to Amazon's terms, conditions, and fulfillment policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">4. Merchant Details & Inquiries</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          <strong class="text-[#7A5212] block mb-1">Somashiva</strong>
          Electronic City, Bangalore, Karnataka - 560100, India<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:somashivaofficial@gmail.com" class="text-[#996515] underline font-medium">somashivaofficial@gmail.com</a> | Phone: +91 9180603108
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
